# tools.list — the tools ~/dev/ai/README.md lists, with their path and version.
# command | how to ask its version | what it is for
uv        | uv --version      | runs each example with the libraries it names at its top (`uv run ask.py`)
python3   | python3 --version | the examples' language
curl      | set -- $(curl --version); echo $1 $2 | the shell examples: an HTTP request is all an AI API needs
jq        | jq --version      | reads the JSON that comes back
ollama    | ollama --version  | local models (`vikix add local-ai`): `ollama list`, `ollama pull all-minilm`
llm       | llm --version     | AI on the command line, local or Claude (`vikix add llm`)
sqlite3   | set -- $(sqlite3 --version); echo $1 | the database the embeddings are kept in, with sqlite-vec
